# The sample access variation point attaches to the HTTP example: it adds its
# middleware packages (todo.command.middleware.{access,batch_limit},
# todo.api.http.middleware.authentication) and changes only the composition
# root, the command it marks, and the readme and Makefile.
base library/architecture/python/vp-http-api-in-python.skill/examples
change src/todo/main.py
change src/todo/command/plan_items.py
change Makefile
change README.md
